              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nubwo ndiijuka endagaano yange naragaine na Yakobbo, ei naragaine na Isaaka kandi ei naragaine n'Abburahamu. Ndiijuka ensi egi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abantu bamazire kugirugamu, eyegondeze omu Sabbato zaayo. Obu eriba esigaire kitongo, balyeeteera habw'ebibi byabo, habwokuba bakanga ebigambo byange, baagaya ebiragiro byange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu noobu kiraaba kiri kiti, obu baliba bakyali omunsi ey'abanyanzigwa baabo, tindibeehooga kandi tindukwija kubanobera kimu, nkabahwerekereza; habwokuba ninyowe MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonka ninyija kubaijuka habw'endagaano ei naragaine na baisenkurubo, aba naihire omunsi Misiri, abanyamahanga nibarora, nukwo mbe Ruhanga wabo, ninyowe MUKAMA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
